# AGENTS.md: {{ service_name }}

{{ description }}. Part of **FamilyMeal**, a family meal planner: an LLM builds a 3–7 day
batch-cooking menu from a recipe catalog, recipes are imported by URL, and a shopping list
is built from the accepted plan.

This file is for coding agents (Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, ...) and humans alike.
Cross-service rules, contracts and ADRs live in the **meal-platform** repository;
read its `AGENTS.md` before changing anything that crosses a service boundary.

## Commands

| Task | Command |
|---|---|
| Install deps and hooks | `make install` |
| Everything CI runs | `make check` |
| Lint / autofix | `make lint` / `make fmt` |
| Types (pyright strict) | `make typecheck` |
| Layer contracts (import-linter) | `make imports` |
| Tests | `make test` or `uv run pytest tests/test_x.py -k name` |
| Tests without `integration` ones{% if with_database or with_cache %} (no Docker){% endif %} | `make test-unit` |
{%- if with_database %}
| Apply migrations | `make migrate` (`DB__URL` from `.env`; deploys run `python -m {{ package_name }} migrate`) |
